{
  "html": "<h1 id=\"a-heading-one\">A heading one</h1>\n<p>Plain text with <em>emphasis</em>, <strong>strong</strong>, <em><strong>both</strong></em>, <em>underscored</em> and <code>inline code</code>.\nA soft line break, then a <a href=\"https://example.com\" title=\"Title\">link</a>, an autolink <a href=\"https://ry-mart.com\">https://ry-mart.com</a>,\na bare <a href=\"https://example.org/path\">https://example.org/path</a> and a <a href=\"https://example.net/ref\">reference link</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"times-and-ratios\">Times and ratios</h2>\n<p>The video is 16:9, the talk starts at 10:30am, and C++ uses a::b for scopes.\nEmoji shortcodes like :smile: stay as text, and so does note:thing.</p>\n<p>:::note\nContainer syntax is not part of the format.\n:::</p>\n<h2 id=\"lists\">Lists</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>one</li>\n<li>two\n<ul>\n<li>nested</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>three</li>\n</ul>\n<ol>\n<li>first</li>\n<li>second</li>\n</ol>\n<p>A paragraph between lists.</p>\n<ol start=\"7\">\n<li>starts at seven</li>\n<li>eight</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Another paragraph.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>loose item</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>another loose item</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Tasks:</p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> a task</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled> a done task</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"code\">Code</h2>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> answer</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 42</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> retry</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    pass</span></span></code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-not-a-language\">plain text block\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code>no language\n</code></pre>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"meta string\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre>\n<pre><code>indented code\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"quotes-and-rules\">Quotes and rules</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>A quote with <strong>bold</strong>.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>A nested quote.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tables-and-more\">Tables and more</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th align=\"right\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>a</td>\n<td align=\"right\">1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>b</td>\n<td align=\"right\">2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><del>struck</del> text, a footnote<sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-1\" id=\"user-content-fnref-1\" data-footnote-ref aria-describedby=\"footnote-label\">1</a></sup>, and a hard<br>\nbreak with two trailing spaces<br>\nhere.</p>\n<h2 id=\"raw-html-is-dropped\">Raw HTML is dropped</h2>\n<p>Inline bold and  are stripped.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://example.com/a.png\" alt=\"An image\" title=\"Image title\"></p>\n<p>Entities: © &#x26; &#x3C;tag> and a literal *not emphasis*.</p>\n<h2 id=\"repeated-heading\">Repeated heading</h2>\n<h2 id=\"repeated-heading-1\">Repeated heading</h2>\n<h3 id=\"a-third-level-heading\">A third-level heading</h3>\n<h4 id=\"fourth\">Fourth</h4>\n<h5 id=\"fifth\">Fifth</h5>\n<h6 id=\"sixth\">Sixth</h6>\n<section data-footnotes class=\"footnotes\"><h2 class=\"sr-only\" id=\"footnote-label\">Footnotes</h2>\n<ol>\n<li id=\"user-content-fn-1\">\n<p>The footnote. <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-1\" data-footnote-backref=\"\" aria-label=\"Back to reference 1\" class=\"data-footnote-backref\">↩</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</section>",
